      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RED REIGN (1) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 5.5 lengths at Maitland in a handy 22.22 beating Hello Aerial. Nicely placed here on the inside and goes well over this trip. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Can continue on with his winning form. BLUE CHANELLE (2) drew a squeeze box and was game in defeat when a close second, one length from the winner Novel (23.18) at this track. Will give a great sight again. CAMARO ROSE (5) struggled for best form latest, finishing 4th (23.34) in a Grade 5 at this track. Form here at this distance is strong including three wins. Boasts two wins from five starts out of this box. Has the ability to give this a shake. TIGER TAILS (3) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
